    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <strong>Schr\u00f6dinger's Maze</strong> \u2013 an adventure set in a world of quantum vision!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this maze, only what\u2019s within your line of sight <strong>truly exists</strong>. Everything beyond it falls into a quantum superposition\u2014caught between existence and oblivion.<br>A single step can flip your reality: what appears to be a wall might be an illusion; what seems like an enemy could be a hidden treasure or a key!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift your perspective to clear the fog of uncertainty. When all paths seem blocked, change your view\u2014<strong>a new way forward may reveal itself where none seemed to exist</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Combat follows a tower-style strategy system</strong>:<br>Absorb gems, unlock chests, upgrade gear, activate your skill tree, and defeat powerful bosses as you gradually unlock your quantum potential.<br>Ultimately, <strong>become the one who uncovers the true nature of the Maze</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 Special Crossover Event: <i>Schr\u00f6dinger\u2019s Maze \u00d7 Dungeon of the Magic Tower</i> Now Live!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters unlocked in <i>Dungeon of the Magic Tower</i> are now fully playable in <i>Schr\u00f6dinger\u2019s Maze</i>!<br>With over <strong>30 unique characters</strong> to choose from, build your own multiverse exploration team and dive into the unknown!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <strong>Schr\u00f6dinger's Maze</strong> \u2013 an adventure set in a world of quantum vision!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this maze, only what\u2019s within your line of sight <strong>truly exists</strong>. Everything beyond it falls into a quantum superposition\u2014caught between existence and oblivion.<br>A single step can flip your reality: what appears to be a wall might be an illusion; what seems like an enemy could be a hidden treasure or a key!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift your perspective to clear the fog of uncertainty. When all paths seem blocked, change your view\u2014<strong>a new way forward may reveal itself where none seemed to exist</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Combat follows a tower-style strategy system</strong>:<br>Absorb gems, unlock chests, upgrade gear, activate your skill tree, and defeat powerful bosses as you gradually unlock your quantum potential.<br>Ultimately, <strong>become the one who uncovers the true nature of the Maze</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 Special Crossover Event: <i>Schr\u00f6dinger\u2019s Maze \u00d7 Dungeon of the Magic Tower</i> Now Live!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters unlocked in <i>Dungeon of the Magic Tower</i> are now fully playable in <i>Schr\u00f6dinger\u2019s Maze</i>!<br>With over <strong>30 unique characters</strong> to choose from, build your own multiverse exploration team and dive into the unknown!</p>",
    "short_description": "Schr\u00f6dinger\u2019s Maze is an indie adventure game that combines tower-style combat with a real-time generated maze system. In this ever-shifting labyrinth, only what\u2019s within your field of view truly &quot;exists&quot;",
